flowchart TB
    accTitle: Repair missing CRDT state
    accDescr: Missing positions are replayed if retained; unavailable history can use a dominating complete baseline. Explicit refusal is scoped to its source.
    Summary["Compare history and receipts<br/>Known maximum is not receipt"]
    Range["Request missing positions<br/>Source, origin, attempt and deadline"]
    Replay["Retained history available<br/>Apply correlated replay page"]
    Baseline["History unavailable<br/>Request complete CRDT baseline"]
    Validate["Validate baseline and cut<br/>Payload, digest, coverage and state"]
    Install["Install accepted progress<br/>State and durable receipt tracking"]
    Refuse["Explicit source refusal<br/>Incomplete, oversized or conflicting"]
    Continue["Continue periodic repair"]
    Summary -->|"Gap found"| Range
    Range -->|"Retained"| Replay
    Range -->|"Unavailable"| Baseline
    Replay -->|"Persist before publish"| Install
    Baseline --> Validate
    Validate -->|"Dominating complete cut"| Install
    Validate -->|"Outside contract"| Refuse
    Install --> Continue
    Refuse -->|"Another source may help"| Continue
